    "html": "<p>An object performs simple harmonic motion. When the displacement of the object is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{x_{0}}{2}\"></span> the kinetic energy of the object is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"E\"></span>.</p>\n<p>What is the total energy of the motion? <br/><br/></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{3E}{4}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{4E}{3}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\">2<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"E\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\">4<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"E\"></span></li></ol>"
